# THIS REPO'S OWN dispatch receipts, mirroring the payload copy next door in
# core/.agents/receipts/.gitignore. The reasoning -- what is ephemeral and why
# nothing here is committed any more -- lives there.
#
# scripts/check-root-wiring.mjs compares the pattern lines below against the
# payload copy and fails when they diverge. Edit the payload copy; this one
# follows.
fable-*.json
